---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-08-29';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Archive privacy notice"
  description="Privacy notice for the archived Verified Bases research surface."
>
  <section class="container-page pt-14 pb-8 md:pt-20">
    <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl text-balance">
      This archive does not accept orders or submissions.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-faint">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-page max-w-3xl pb-24">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed text-pretty">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">What the archive collects</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The static research surface may record aggregate, cookieless page-performance
          and usage events when monitoring is configured. It does not offer checkout,
          collect payment details, accept purchase intent, or accept marketplace submissions.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Historical infrastructure</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The repository retains prototype integrations for Cloudflare, Dodo Payments,
          and Resend as implementation evidence. Their presence in source does not mean
          those customer workflows are active on this archived surface.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Email <a class="link text-accent" href="mailto:sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com">sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com</a>
          for access or deletion questions about information retained from the prototype period.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
